abstract: >
  LLM-PathwayCurator links pathway enrichment records to statistical observations
  and supplied interpretations. It preserves source identities, displays shared
  supporting genes, and applies predefined checks to recognized assertions in
  the text. Structured records and reproducible reports support human review.
